The industry standard user interface toolkit for the X Window System.

This is thentenaar's actively maintained fork of Motif, based on Open
Motif 2.3.8 from ICS MotifZone.  It includes modern build and
portability fixes, UTF-8 XmString handling, Xcursor/Xrandr/Xinerama
support with basic DPI scaling, removal of the bundled libXpm and
PrintShell, and pkg-config files for the libraries.
